					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quamvis vix mihi sint manus sufficientes, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad te scribam, ita totus lavando undique ebullientibus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>pustulis squalleo, nolui tamen hunc sine meis ad te di<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mittere, ut videas plus mihi esse voluntatis quam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>facultatis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Heri redditae sunt mihi tuae 3. Mai datae, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quibus scribis primo de <persName ref="p8437">Erasmo Fabritio</persName> hic decumbente.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Misi ad illum matris suae literas percontatus simul de eius <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>valetudine, quam non admodum male habere intelligo.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Promisit <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>se ipsum matri velle scribere; quodsi videro aliquam exigere <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>necessitatem, non ei deero etiam pecuniis, id quod matri meo <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nomine promittas velim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hodie perferuntur ad me literae <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>admodum prolixae D. <persName ref="p7201">Jacobi Zorn</persName>, parochi aliquando <placeName ref="l1731">Regenstor<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ffensis</placeName>; cupit hic etiam apud nostros promoveri, praetendit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nescio quas suae reiectionis causas, quibus ego parum fido, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nisi ex te prius intellexero, quomodo res illius habeant; sunt <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>enim mihi ignotae.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Poteris ergo me certiorem reddere; eo usque <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>enim nihil illi respondebo, donec ex te sciam, qualis sit aut <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quid illi credendum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Min herren baid schultheß <persName ref="p2305">Nägeli</persName> und seckelmeister <persName ref="p8012">Haller</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sind gen <placeName ref="l760">Sollothurn</placeName>, doch niener umb anders dann abschlegig <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>antwurt zuͦ geben.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Gester sagt mir fenner <persName ref="p8389">imm Hag</persName>, <placeName ref="l781">Uri</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sye nitt da; wellinds gar abschlahen, haltind auch anderen <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Orten an, das si nitt darin gangind; in <placeName ref="l791">Wallis</placeName> habinds fünff <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>zenden auch abgschlagen, allein zwen bewilliget.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Graf von <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l2673">Gryers</placeName> habe auch den sinen bi kopfabhawen verbotten, das sin ne<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>mand dencke; doch habind die von <placeName ref="l436">Sanen</placeName> etwas bottschaffts <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l760">Solloturn</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">In <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName>, schript mir <persName ref="p3429">Viretus</persName>, wüte <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>die persequutio über dmaß; sye kein end.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> und <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p4744">Fagius</persName> sind in <placeName ref="l830">Engelland</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">So vil diß mal.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Gott <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>sye mitt üch und den üweren allen; die gruͤßend von <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>mir und allem minem volk.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Üch gruͤßt wider her fenner <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName ref="p8389">im Hag</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> 13. Mai 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Tuus, quem nosti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Fidelissimo domino nostri Iesu <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Christi servo D. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bulli<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ngero</persName>, domino suo observando.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
